#SKIPTEST
' Change 1663: a sub parameter with the name of a bit on the chip is an error, with the line of the sub.
' Build 1662 gave no warning: Show(1) compiled to bsf CM1CON,CON, and the assembler stopped with
' "Conflicting definition for CON sub parameter variable. %var% is a %type%. Invalid source variable type".
' Expected (build 1663): Error: Parameter name CON is the name of bit CM1CON.7 on the current chip: ...
#chip 18F46J50, 48
#option explicit
Dir PORTB Out
Do
    Show(1)
Loop

Sub Show(In COn)
    PORTB = COn
End Sub
